{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>And when a man sells a dwelling house in a walled city.</b> 'A man' — this is the Holy One, blessed be He, as it is said: 'יהוה איש מלחמה' — meaning master and lord, like 'איש נעמי' — who sold the dwelling of His house to the Chaldeans, as it is said: 'כי בחר יהוה בציון אוה למושב לו'." "<b>And its redemption shall be until the end of the year of its sale.</b> As it is said: 'לפי מלאת לבבל שבעים שנה אפקוד אתכם'."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:36.392765188Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}